{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/preferences"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"Preferences","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey"],"anchor":"Protocols","title":"Protocols"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"],"anchor":"Storage","title":"Storage"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit’s preference system enables "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"bottom-up data flow","type":"text"}]},{"text":": the reverse of environment values. While the environment passes data down from parent to child, preferences let child views publish values that ancestors can observe and react to.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system mirrors SwiftUI’s preference API and consists of three parts:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Protocol that defines a named value type with a default and a reduce strategy"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PreferenceValues"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Type-safe storage that holds all preference values for a scope","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"PreferenceStorage","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Stack-based collector that manages preference contexts per render pass"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A built-in example is "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a child view sets "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationTitle(\"Settings\")"},{"type":"text","text":", and the enclosing navigation container reads that preference to render the title bar."}]},{"anchor":"Defining-a-Preference-Key","type":"heading","text":"Defining a Preference Key","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A preference key declares what type of value it carries and how multiple values from sibling children are combined:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct CounterKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: Int = 0","","    static func reduce(value: inout Int, nextValue: () -> Int) {","        value += nextValue()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"defaultValue","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Returned when no child has set this preference"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"reduce(value:nextValue:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":": Combines values when multiple children set the same key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation simply takes the last value. Override it when you need additive behavior (summing counts), array collection, or other merge strategies."}]},{"anchor":"Setting-a-Preference","type":"heading","text":"Setting a Preference","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Child views publish a preference using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".preference(key:value:)"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Item\")","            .preference(key: CounterKey.self, value: 1)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the hood, this wraps the view in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"text":" that calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferences.setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"text":" during rendering. The value is reduced into the current scope using the key’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reduce"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Observing-Preferences","type":"heading","text":"Observing Preferences","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ancestor views react to collected preferences using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onPreferenceChange(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemList: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","            ItemView()","        }","        .onPreferenceChange(CounterKey.self) { totalCount in","            \/\/ totalCount == 3 (three children each set value: 1, additive reduce)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier pushes a new preference context, renders all children (which set their preferences), pops the context, and fires the callback with the accumulated result."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"The Navigation Title Shortcut","level":2,"anchor":"The-Navigation-Title-Shortcut"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit provides ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey"},{"text":" as a built-in preference key with a convenience modifier:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct SettingsPage: View {","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"App settings go here\")","        }","        .navigationTitle(\"Settings\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NavigationTitleKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the default "},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (last value wins), so the deepest child’s title takes precedence."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How Preferences Flow per Frame","level":2,"anchor":"How-Preferences-Flow-per-Frame"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Preferences are collected fresh every frame. Here’s the lifecycle within a single render pass:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop.render()"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferences.beginRenderPass()"},{"type":"text","text":", clearing all callbacks and resetting the stack to a single empty context"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": As the view tree renders top-down, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" views call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setValue(_:forKey:)"},{"type":"text","text":", which reduces values into the current stack frame"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OnPreferenceChangeModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" pushes a new context before rendering its subtree, isolating child preferences"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Collect"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": After the subtree finishes, the modifier pops the context (merging into the parent) and fires the callback with the scoped result","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Discard","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": At the start of the next frame, everything resets: stale preferences never persist"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This per-frame reset ensures preferences always reflect the current view tree. Removed views stop contributing automatically.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Reduce Strategies","level":2,"anchor":"Reduce-Strategies"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"reduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function determines how multiple children’s values combine. Common patterns:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strategy","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use Case","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Last value wins"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value = nextValue()"},{"text":" (default)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Titles, labels: deepest child wins","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Additive","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value += nextValue()"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Counting items, summing heights","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array collection"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gathering menu items, breadcrumbs"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Array collection example","struct BreadcrumbKey: PreferenceKey {","    static let defaultValue: [String] = []","","    static func reduce(value: inout [String], nextValue: () -> [String]) {","        value.append(contentsOf: nextValue())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass data from child views up to their ancestors."}],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/NavigationTitleKey":{"kind":"symbol","title":"NavigationTitleKey","abstract":[{"text":"A preference key for the navigation title.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NavigationTitleKey","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/navigationtitlekey","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/NavigationTitleKey","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NavigationTitleKey","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit":{"images":[{"identifier":"tuikit-logo.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"tuikit-logo.png","type":"card"}],"type":"topic","title":"TUIkit","ide